  "passage": {
    "text": "A customer in Riga orders ten boxes of office chairs. The logistics team must plan the delivery. First, they choose the best route. The route from Kaunas to Riga is about three hundred kilometres. Then they check the schedule. The deadline is Friday, so the truck must leave on Wednesday. Workers load the boxes and a driver checks the shipment. If there is a delay on the road, the driver calls the office. The team tells the customer about the new time. Customers like honest information.",
